itude|dc:23] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is temporarily immune to bioluminescence for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round, then dazzled for 1 round.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["light","primal","visual"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"QYPnMIiKEjfcOhmR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Leech Life","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The coenosteum knight has 60 or fewer Hit Points remaining</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The knight desperately draws in the vitality from nearby creatures to shore up the damage to their reefs. Each creature within 20 feet of the knight that is not in the knight's square takes @Damage[6d6[void]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:26|basic] save). The knight gains 6d6 temporary Hit Points.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["death","primal","void"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false,"selfEffect":{"